Remove raw-register, PCI-configuration, PHY, EEPROM-write, procfs, sysfs and
cable-test engineering interfaces from the Realtek R8126 10.018.00 driver.
Retain normal networking, RSS, Wake-on-LAN, standard ethtool operations and
EEPROM reads. Also remove the unconditional probe-time licence banner; the
source SPDX declarations remain authoritative.

